Third-party components
----------------------

TizenTube
  Copyright (c) Reis Can (reisxd) and TizenTube contributors
  https://github.com/reisxd/TizenTube
  License: GNU General Public License v3.0 only (GPL-3.0-only)
  Loaded at runtime from https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@foxreis/tizentube
  (inject.js) and bundled by the Tizen module / optional webOS build
  (platforms/build_platforms.py). youtube-plus.js renames TizenTube's settings
  screen in the TV UI to "YouTube +" and hides its support / social links; that
  is a cosmetic change only. TizenTube's copyright and license are unchanged,
  and this notice and the README keep the credit.

MuTube (mutube)
  The tvOS patcher this project grew from (patcher.py, inject.js).

iOS app (platforms/ios)
  Original YouTube + code (Swift shell and platforms/ios/js/youtube-plus-ios.js).
  It does not bundle TizenTube. When the matching setting is on, the injected
  script calls the public SponsorBlock / DeArrow API (sponsor.ajay.app) and
  the Return YouTube Dislike API (returnyoutubedislikeapi.com).

